flowchart TD
  subgraph ClaudeHooks["claude/hooks tests"]
    C_runner[test-hook.sh: cmd_run, cmd_selftest, expect_exit/expect_contains/expect_empty] --> C_scripts[exercises every claude/hooks/*.sh via fake stdin payloads]
    C_pytest[test_context_augment.py: Keywords, Abstraction, Minify, EndToEnd, NoLedger, KeywordPrecision] --> ctx[context-augment.py]
